  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/IMG_4041.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Fanzara contin&uacute;a inmersa este domingo en su Feria Medieval, que se ha inaugurado a mediod&iacute;a del s&aacute;bado y</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/ProgramaFeriaMedievalFanzara121314agosto.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 683px;\" /></p>\n<p>en la que se pueden visitar diversas paradas, como la de cer&aacute;mica del ondense Ximo Safont, la de bisuter&iacute;a artesana de Lamorena de Borriol. o tomar algo en la Tasca la Tahona de la Serra d&#39;en Galceran.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara2016/img_4034.jpg\" alt=\"img_4034\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara2016/img_4035.jpg\" alt=\"img_4035\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara2016/img_4036.jpg\" alt=\"img_4036\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara2016/img_4038.jpg\" alt=\"img_4038\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara2016/img_4039.jpg\" alt=\"img_4039\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara2016/img_4041.jpg\" alt=\"img_4041\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara2016/img_4043.jpg\" alt=\"img_4043\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/feriamedievalfanzara2016/img_40